WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,500
hundreds of years

2
00:00:02,170 --> 00:00:03,850
Isn’t that the big money in previous sessions?

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,850
No one has cleared the level in the Hanjin Desert.

4
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:09,170
Because all the friends who came here are dead

5
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:11,730
It has become the nutrient for the growth of cultivated flowers.

6
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:15,370
The Hanjin Desert has long become the auspicious valley of death for competitions.

7
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,200
And this cultivated flower stamen

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,560
