14
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:43,240
Do you want Golden Desert?

15
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,480
Don’t want me to take it back

16
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:55,320
The one from mother-in-law and mother

17
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,320
Do I get any reward?

18
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,210
I'll kill you

19
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:04,530
This is the biggest reward for you

20
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:07,570
What else do you want?

21
00:01:08,010 --> 00:01:09,290
I don't want anything anymore
